=head1 DESCRIPTION

The time units that, with C<IdTokenValidity>, C<AccessTokenValidity>,
and C<RefreshTokenValidity>, set and display the duration of ID,
access, and refresh tokens for an app client. You can assign a separate
token validity unit to each type of token.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 AccessToken => Str

A time unit for the value that you set in the C<AccessTokenValidity>
parameter. The default C<AccessTokenValidity> time unit is C<hours>.
C<AccessTokenValidity> duration can range from five minutes to one day.


=head2 IdToken => Str

A time unit for the value that you set in the C<IdTokenValidity>
parameter. The default C<IdTokenValidity> time unit is C<hours>.
C<IdTokenValidity> duration can range from five minutes to one day.


=head2 RefreshToken => Str

A time unit for the value that you set in the C<RefreshTokenValidity>
parameter. The default C<RefreshTokenValidity> time unit is C<days>.
C<RefreshTokenValidity> duration can range from 60 minutes to 10 years.



